            "y": 288,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nThe connected LinkedIn account must be an approved **ADMINISTRATOR** of at least one company page, and the account must come from a LinkedIn app with the **Community Management API** product. The flow posts publicly as the first page returned by `organizationAcls` and deletes the post after AfterAll, so keep the delete step. If the flow stops in between, delete the post on the page by hand."
